---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung unisex | Streetwear import';
const description = 'Pantaloni cu snur lung unisex din materiale premium, stil streetwear si link direct catre AtelierAXD. Descopera colectia acum!';
const canonical = 'https://pantalonicusnurlung.ro/';
const image = '/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg';
const schema = { '@context':'https://schema.org', '@type':'ClothingStore', name:title, url:canonical, image:new URL(image, canonical).href };
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} image={image} type="website" schema={schema}>
<section id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="container"><div class="hero-inner-wrapper"><div class="hero-content"><div class="hero-badge">Streetwear Premium Import</div><h1 class="hero-h1">Pantaloni cu<br/><span class="line2">snur lung.</span><br/>Stil urban.</h1><p class="hero-sub">Redefineste-ti tinuta cu selectia noastra de pantaloni cu snur lung unisex, streetwear de import, materiale durabile si croiala relaxata.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi" class="btn-primary">Vezi colectia</a><a href="/ghid-marimi-pantaloni-cu-snur" class="btn-ghost">Ghid marimi</a></div></div><div class="hero-promo-box"><div class="promo-title">Oferta speciala</div><div class="promo-big">4 PRODUSE</div><div class="promo-highlight">-15% reducere</div><div class="promo-desc">Cumpara orice 4 produse din magazinul AtelierAXD si reducerea se aplica automat la check-out.</div><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi" class="promo-btn">Profita acum</a></div></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">100<span>%</span></div><div class="stat-label">Calitate superioara</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Unisex</div><div class="stat-label">Purtat si de femei</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">1-3<span>zile</span></div><div class="stat-label">Timp livrare</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="stat-num">Card</div><div class="stat-label">sau ramburs</div></div></div></div></section><section class="section" id="colectie"><div class="container"><div class="services-header reveal"><div><span class="section-tag">// Magazin niche</span><h2 class="section-h2">Alege modelul de <em>pantaloni</em> preferat</h2></div><p class="section-lead">Importam si comercializam croieli streetwear cautate, disponibile prin AtelierAXD, cu accent pe pantaloni cu snur lung, negru, lejer si unisex.</p></div><div class="services-grid"><a class="service-card featured reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-largi-negri-snur-casual.jpg" alt="Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual" title="Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual" width="1200" height="1600" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni barbati largi negri snur casual</div><div class="service-desc">Croiala loose-fit perfecta pentru un aspect relaxat. Echilibru intre streetwear si casual, purtat usor de baieti si fete.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Bestseller</span><span class="tag">Unisex Loose</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-negri-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung" title="Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni barbati negri snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Varianta clasica reinventata, cu material durabil, asezare buna pe sneakers si snur lung vizibil.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Classic Fit</span><span class="tag">Import</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-scurti-negri-cu-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung" title="Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni scurti negri cu snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Pentru sezonul cald: acelasi impact vizual streetwear intr-o pereche scurta si confortabila.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Summer</span><span class="tag">Shorts</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-scurti-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung" title="Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri scurti snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Alternativa pentru zile de vara petrecute in oras, cu material placut si croiala lejera.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Breeze Fit</span><span class="tag">Urban</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal " href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-oversized-barbati-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung" title="Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri oversized barbati snur lung</div><div class="service-desc">Baggy, masiv, pur streetwear. Pentru look foarte larg inspirat din cultura urbana internationala.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Oversized</span><span class="tag">Baggy</span></div></a><a class="service-card  reveal reveal-delay-1" href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi"><div class="service-arrow">-></div><div class="card-img-wrap"><img src="/pantaloni-negri-slim-snur-lung-atelieraxd.jpg" alt="Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD" title="Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></div><div class="service-name">Pantaloni negri slim snur lung AtelierAXD</div><div class="service-desc">Slim-fit selectat pentru asezare mai apropiata de corp, pastrand detaliul urban al snurului lung.</div><div class="service-tags"><span class="tag">Slim Fit</span><span class="tag">AtelierAXD</span></div></a></div></div></section><section class="section" id="lookbook"><div class="container"><div class="services-header reveal"><div><span class="section-tag">// Purtat si de ea</span><h2 class="section-h2">Menswear? Mai degraba <em>Unisex.</em></h2></div><p class="section-lead">Desi multe modele vin din zona menswear, croielile loose-fit si snurul lung le fac potrivite si pentru tinute feminine, streetwear si relaxate.</p></div><div class="lookbook-grid reveal reveal-delay-1"><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/pantaloni-femei-streetwear-snur-lung.png" alt="Streetwear dama cu pantaloni cu snur lung" title="Streetwear dama" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Streetwear dama</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/tinuta-unisex-pantaloni-largi-snur-extra-lung.png" alt="Tinuta unisex cu pantaloni largi si snur extra lung" title="Unisex fit" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Unisex fit</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/outfit-casual-tricou-pantaloni-negri-snur-lung.png" alt="Outfit casual cu tricou si pantaloni negri cu snur lung" title="Urban casual" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Urban casual</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/pantaloni-baggy-fete-snur-lung-atelieraxd.png" alt="Pantaloni baggy pentru fete cu snur lung AtelierAXD" title="Baggy style" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Baggy style</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/detaliu-snur-lung-pantaloni-oversized-dama.png" alt="Detaliu snur lung la pantaloni oversized de dama" title="Oversized details" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Oversized details</span></figcaption></figure><figure class="lookbook-item"><img src="/moda-urbana-pantaloni-unisex-cu-snur-lung.png" alt="Moda urbana cu pantaloni unisex cu snur lung" title="Urban fashion" width="1080" height="1440" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><figcaption class="lookbook-overlay"><span class="lookbook-title">Urban fashion</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section class="owner-section" id="despre"><div class="container reveal"><div class="owner-grid"><img src="/pantaloni-barbati-negri-snur-lung.jpg" alt="Pantaloni cu snur lung purtati in stil streetwear" title="Pantaloni cu snur lung streetwear" width="1200" height="1600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="owner-img" /><div class="owner-text"><span class="section-tag">// Povestea magazinului</span><h2 class="section-h2" style="margin-bottom:20px">Pasiune pentru <em>Streetwear</em></h2><p>La PantaloniCuSnurLung.ro strangem intr-un singur loc informatia si directia vizuala pentru pantalonii cu snur lung. Site-ul functioneaza ca hub dedicat, iar achizitia se face prin AtelierAXD.</p><p>Modelul cu snur lung este ales pentru impact vizual, confort si felul in care se aseaza in tinute urbane. Croiala poate fi loose, oversized, slim sau scurta, dar ideea ramane aceeasi: o piesa simpla, neagra, usor de purtat.</p><a href="https://atelieraxd.ro/pantaloni-lungi" class="btn-primary">pantaloni cu snur lung atelieraxd</a></div></div></div></section></Layout>
